I need to verify with myself about the communications part though;
I mean yeah there were a lot of cases in my studies where communication in a group was crucial; I often took initiative: planning meetings via group chats etc. 
And then about the phoning stuff: There was this one course that thought us the basics: how to respond, what to do and what not to do, the "dentist technique" (describe everything you're doing to the person you're on the phone with), etc
